Lock clock, halo, greeting, date and weather decided by BlueOSColorRoles (roles instead of colours) and recoloured on theme / palette changes; AOD neutral grey with outline / shadow and a 500 ms cross-fade from the lock screen; BlueOSLockProtection dims the wallpaper under light lock text («Защита читаемости», «Сила защиты») under the status bar; «Уведомления в лобби» (as usual / hidden / a tap decides); widgets: «Сводка» text colours resolved by the launcher's theme (it lagged after light <-> dark), music note primary, titles break after _ . -, toggles with labels, narrow equalizer player, «Тишина», back / forward buttons and a wave for «Эквалайзер: плеер».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I9ac6a63248aeffb1abd1f418ceebdcc08a4a334e
